{
  "task_id": "dedup-A",
  "name": "Elite person-merge — same or different? (150)",
  "version": "2026-07-06",
  "id_field": "row_id",
  "instructions": "An INCOMING elite record (left) was matched to a person already on the registry spine (right). Is it the SAME human? Sorted HARD-FIRST by smallest score_gap (the top match barely beat the runner-up — the ambiguous calls that teach the matcher the most). match_basis: 2tok=surname+given only; +patr adds patronymic; region+2tok adds region; qid=Wikidata id. SAME = merge; DIFFERENT = two people wrongly merged (split); UNSURE if the spine record is too thin to judge.",
